94	    /** Change a draft claim's amount, date and note; a date left out takes the sheet's today. Refused
95	     *  when the claim is not a draft (an open claim is changed by voiding it and adding a new one), and
96	     *  when the claim's date, or the new one, falls inside a closed period, and when the new one is
97	     *  after the person's retirement day. */
98	    @Transactional
99	    public Claim edit(String sheetId, String user, long claimId, BigDecimal amount, LocalDate date, String note,
100	            String corrects) {
101	        Claim claim = lock(sheetId, claimId);
102	        if (claim.getStatus() != ClaimStatus.DRAFT || claim.editLockedFor(user)) {
